{%- comment -%}
  fmx-note-photo (magyx.co): English note name -> note photo filename in Shopify Files (copied from tryscent.co).
  Usage: {%- capture f -%}{%- render 'fmx-note-photo', name: note -%}{%- endcapture -%} -> "note_vanilla.jpg" or empty (magyx.co Files holds the photos as .jpg).
  Same photos and the same matching rule as tryscent.co's Swedish map: the note itself, or the same note with an origin
  or variety ("calabrian bergamot", "damask rose", "white musk"). Only true matches, no stand-in photos.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign fmx_n = name | downcase | strip -%}
{%- case fmx_n -%}
  {%- when 'akigalawood' -%}note_akigalawood.jpg
  {%- when 'aldehydes' -%}note_aldehydes.jpg
  {%- when 'almond', 'bitter almond' -%}note_almond.jpg
  {%- when 'amber', 'amberwood' -%}note_amber.jpg
